<title>NETHERLANDS: Endemol H1 96/97 net profit NLG 33.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Endemol H1 96/97 net profit NLG 33.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LAREN, Netherlands 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>First-half 1996/97</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    33.7  vs  28.3</p>
<p>    Turnover			     441.0  vs 318.0</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    49.0  vs  43.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected television production firm Endemol to report a first-half 1996/97 net profit of 36 million to 40 million guilders.  </p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			  52.1    vs   45.2</p>
<p>    Tax					 15.8    vs   16.8</p>
<p>The company's financial year runs from August until July 31.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
